From f0a81082ab390a6a595a51375aa6322cc4405c9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 2ax4 <2ax4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:55:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Offline build: drop the translations of the strings the
 patches removed

The partner banners (Ad-free) and the sign-in notice reworded for the
offline build no longer exist in the sources, and the launcher's i18n
tests fail when a language file keeps a string the code does not have.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015USsS1epujWFNzFvcAWtD9
